<title>SPAIN: Spain's Cubiertas won a 1.83 bln pta contract.</title>
<headline>Spain's Cubiertas won a 1.83 bln pta contract.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Gas firm Enagas, said it had awarded a 1.83 billion pesetas contract to build a gas pipeline Villalba-Tuy, in the Galician region, to Spanish construction group Cubiertas.</p>
<p>The statement added that the contract should be completed in about a year.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
